glassPane & copperRotor & bronzeCurvedPlate --> craftFluidPipe --> fluidPipe

subgraph Bronze compressor
    bronzeCompressor[Bronze compressor]
end

craftBronzeCompressor{Craft}

copperRod & copperGear & fluidPipe & forgeHammer & bronzeMachineCasing --> craftBronzeCompressor --> bronzeCompressor